  <item>
    <title>013. 套路对学习有用吗？ with 盛申老师</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/684a95171c88ae1166d23c4f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">684a95171c88ae1166d23c4f</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Jun 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎添加主播 xue_shirong 的微信，备注“真心”，加入听友群。</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：盛申老师（微信号：shsalex），复旦数学系学霸，如今是一名初中数学学习力教练。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">5:30</a> 那些年，我见过的“解题大招”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="566">9:26</a> “套路”的好处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a> “套路”能有效击穿家长的认同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1295">21:35</a> 学写作，要不要“高仿”范文？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a> 竟然还有这样的“数学母题解题大招”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi0aXwdyq93iQJusgyaHaMGnYpv7.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2290">38:10</a> 语文阅读理解中的“坑爹”vs. 靠谱套路</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnhJZChru2T1F5BfjA64fJ4k4PQ4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkKIP_gbPIHKw_8opAfCYr3HGW0g.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiFTcjWOysuCTqjYlOxNIyj6s4a1.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2945">49:05</a> 学习的建构主义观：为什么框架不能给太细</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3080">51:20</a> 国外大学教材为什么那么厚？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3390">56:30</a> 为什么考驾照时，我特别想要“无脑套路”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后放一张我的简介与广告（中小学生写作教练）。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FniX0OEIULQooPhRkjA6GLuLafsr.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/672598b1ad979a9c7941be0b/loDESEGYirkYYrlLRR6zhOXsZfNd.m4a" length="57835094" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:19</itunes:duration>
