    <guid isPermaLink="false">67de2de6dd11f9c8c14f397a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾豆子有多家互联网大厂尤其是电商类平台的工作经历，今天来和我们聊聊消费者心理，欢迎留言，说说你的不同看法哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">1:38</a> 互联网公司里的产品、运营、开发都是干嘛的？说人话的版本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">8:08</a> 用户运营，是和精明的用户谈恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="687">11:27</a> 爱计算优惠的我们，真的精明吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="919">15:19</a> 贵一点，但是我很好：娟姗牛奶要吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1106">18:26</a> 我们都爱做能轻松胜任的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1234">20:34</a> 跟着豆子做一个脑力游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1683">28:03</a> 会员等级金字塔尖上的三类人</span></p><span></span><p><span>欲加入听友群，请添加微信：xue_shirong</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/672598b1ad979a9c7941be0b/lnYwpVgYj8carPKsxVC5kMW9BiFu.m4a" length="32139963" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:28</itunes:duration>
