  </item>
  <item>
    <title>008. 投资界的“扫地僧” with Kelvin</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c3a2d4b0167b8db9dbe998</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c3a2d4b0167b8db9dbe998</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Kelvin是我的同学，在我眼中就是一位投资界的“扫地僧”，从初中起就开始做投资，业绩优异（具体请听节目）。先来瞧瞧他古早时期的“投资财报”：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuKFMqVwrE9gzRHngnHvnAGkOlyJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>初中时期的“整（零）存整取分帐本”，投资人生涯从此起步</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnFGiqBJocBDo2gO2HlgeV4LspdT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>高中时期的“2000财政年度中期报告”，此时Kelvin的投资已经从储蓄扩充到债券、保险，并计划进入股票市场。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>在“保险投资”部分，他写道：“购买年金保险......为提前退休作好准备”。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoMUqE6Moqoe9Se9oMFi8ZKQZOjI.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>本科时期的“2003财年投资组合公告（6月）”，储蓄、外汇、股票、基金均已涉猎，数据比高中时又详尽得多。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">2:20</a> 高考考完，第二天我就去开户了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="399">6:39</a> 读金融，是蓄谋已久</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">12:54</a> 我很幸运，因为一进股市就赶上四年的大熊市</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="966">16:06</a> 为什么大多数人容易买在高点？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1309">21:49</a> 我的投资表现在牛市很一般，但在熊市能不亏钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1744">29:04</a> 给投资小白入市的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1991">33:11</a> 一个投资者的一天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2221">37:01</a> 这两年，我对巴菲特有了更深的感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2479">41:19</a> 投资要逆人性，逆的究竟是哪种人性？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2649">44:09</a> 克服人性弱点做投资的两种方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2795">46:35</a> 做定投的关键点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3136">52:16</a> 投资时，我怎么挑选和阅读信息？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3546">59:06</a> 我和金钱的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span>欲加入听友群，请添加微信：xue_shirong</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/672598b1ad979a9c7941be0b/lkdmOgrBNlPs0hz0ZYD5afSkvyF8.m4a" length="65374198" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl8iFDE7QOcIcWp6VPK7hZONiZwQ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>8</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>007. 一个普通人的写作探索 with Kristine</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b9a3e2606e5c59401d54a4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b9a3e2606e5c59401d54a4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>听友们大家好！本期请到的嘉宾是爱写作的Kristine，她是一位对心理学与教育尤其感兴趣的写作者。我们闲聊了各种话题，从第一次写作、那些年遇到的语文老师，到如何带给他人共鸣，以及在写作上如何与AI相处。对写作感兴趣的朋友，欢迎收听~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">2:03</a> 我的第一本日记本和第一个故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="429">7:09</a> 写作能帮我收拾大脑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">9:16</a> 那些年的语文老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1386">23:06</a> 写不出新观点？也许可以换个心态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1617">26:57</a> Me too：展示脆弱的力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2438">40:38</a> AI一边扎到我的痛处，一边哄我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2588">43:08</a> 我和AI在写作上分饰两角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2730">45:30</a> DeepSeek给我的“AI颠覆式写作框架”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3001">50:01</a> 有哪些问AI的好问题？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3135">52:15</a> 哪些写作交给AI，哪些留给自己？</span></p><span></span><p><span>分享一篇Kristine的文章，欢迎关注：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9UuuO5ztGLXE_zRapGPoAQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9UuuO5ztGLXE_zRapGPoAQ"><span>在2024写下的十万字，与过去和未来的无数个十万字</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>欲加入听友群，请添加微信：xue_shirong</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/672598b1ad979a9c7941be0b/lh3MtnJkzJr6PjJ982q1lrPrLiV_.m4a" length="55339187" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:55</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl8iFDE7QOcIcWp6VPK7hZONiZwQ.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>7</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>006. 播客审美行为学 with 腿腿</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a4595bd74435e4a367b410</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67a4595bd74435e4a367b410</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Feb 2025 23:30:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎添加主播xue_shirong的微信，备注“真心”，加入听友群。</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我和“</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6269858ba8f8db2240bb489a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6269858ba8f8db2240bb489a"><span>罅隙电波</span></a><span>”的主播腿腿做了一次串台，一起聊聊“播客审美行为学”（我自己造的词）：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>大家都是怎么听播客的，主播又是怎么录播客的？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>听播客会倍速吗，会听完吗？这背后透露出怎样微妙的心态？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>听播客和看视频、读书有怎样不同的感受？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>嘉宾介绍：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6269858ba8f8db2240bb489a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6269858ba8f8db2240bb489a"><span>罅隙电波</span></a><span>（罅（xia第四声）隙，指缝隙、gap）是一档很特别的播客，聚焦评论（吐槽）各种播客，作为一位“中重度听友”，主播腿腿对播客审美绝对有发言权。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="231">3:51</a> 第一次录“开盲盒”式的播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">8:50</a> 半年前才知道“小宇宙”的我，为什么想要做播客？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a> 做播客，剪还是不剪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1591">26:31</a> 看视频和听音频，心态上到底有什么不同？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2025">33:45</a> “倍速播放”背后的审美心态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2621">43:41</a> 倍速是对感知力的破坏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2780">46:20</a> “听播客总想听完”是一种病吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3135">52:15</a> 内容爆炸的今天，素人的我为什么想做播客？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3712">1:01:52</a> 播客和视频直播有什么区别？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4252">1:10:52</a> 大雾的黑夜中，播客的“人味”让我安心回了家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4625">1:17:05</a> 播客是流水，书是冰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4888">1:21:28</a> 做播客，是有了灵感再录，还是先录了再说？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5136">1:25:36</a> 做播客的两种模式：业余爱好 vs. 运动员训练</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5285">1:28:05</a> 我心目中一次“非常理想”的聊天长什么样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5580">1:33:00</a> 我希望自己做的播客像什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5878">1:37:58</a> 播客的魅力，在于“暧昧 X 神秘”</span></p><span></span><p><span>欲加入听友群，请添加微信：xue_shirong</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/672598b1ad979a9c7941be0b/lkKvskuRMQmfZcmlhVjvz7A9RIql.m4a" length="105648720" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:46:14</itunes:duration>
